                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45f3efbf-cbc2-38e9-ae6a-f20a8bb5884a",
                                        "entry_id": "bccf5b06-e552-31dc-84be-759681afaee2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A list of errands and other tasks – often written on a piece of paper as a memory aid – that one needs or intends to accomplish."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37a3678a-72f3-4282-871a-7b32ec6473ab",
                                                "sense_id": "45f3efbf-cbc2-38e9-ae6a-f20a8bb5884a",
                                                "text": "Mowing the lawn and chopping the weeds topped his to-do list of chores."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6c59728-ada7-4c86-bcf5-dc41cc6ab02e",
                                                "sense_id": "45f3efbf-cbc2-38e9-ae6a-f20a8bb5884a",
                                                "text": "Back in his workshop in the barn, Mr. Scheel refined his to-do list: In addition to putting in the slide, he could cross off restoning the quarter-mile driveway, repairing the windmill-powered watering system and building an arbor gate for the vegetable garden ."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d7d37e3-30e7-48fe-bb31-bb863aab07b6",
                                                "sense_id": "45f3efbf-cbc2-38e9-ae6a-f20a8bb5884a",
                                                "text": "I want to make that strawman into a steelman, but I eliminated \"the pursuit of happiness\" from my to-do list so many years ago that I don't even know where I'd begin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1b70776-3822-4822-bcdb-ab9b073fa538",
                                                "sense_id": "45f3efbf-cbc2-38e9-ae6a-f20a8bb5884a",
                                                "text": "Meanwhile, the Transport Select Committee published its final report on May 28, suggesting that the next government would \"inherit an already long to-do list\" - headed by rail reform, but also including clarity around future rail infrastructure investment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
